.TH PSDictGetOrSet 3 2024-03-09 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSDictGetOrSet\fR \- Get or set item for key

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/utils.h>

.I
PSDictItem  *
.br
\fBPSDictGetOrSet\fR(\fIPSDict *dict\fR, \fIconst char *key\fR, \fIPSDictValue val\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Return value \fIval\fR if it's already set for \fIkey\fR, elseway set it and return it.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The value associated with \fIkey\fR.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1)
